\newlabel{fig:gate}{{5}{8}{\textbf {The capability gate.} Excess hack gap at $n{=}64$ without (orange) and with (blue) a trusted reference, by judge scale and domain. \textbf {Takeaway: the reference collapses inflation at every scale on math, where using it means comparing text, and only at 3B and above on code, where using it means executing tests.}}{figure.caption.21}{}}
